  "selected_complete_reports": 15,
  "scope": "Modeled ZERO and exact pinned Rust R/ONE literals have canonical Montgomery keys0/1. Canonical multiply/optimized square wrappers derive result width/canonicality from reviewed operation contracts using typed operand invariants. Exact source-shaped reverse4word/reverse64bit shift-and-mask loops derive canonical power results and equal returned fields for eager multiply/conditional selection versus branch-only multiply; arbitrary repeated-square count retains canonicality and exact32byte serialization. Static pinned Rust ONE, loop order, bit mask, eager/branch multiply and repeated-square body match model. General exponent value semantics and inverse semantics remain separate; no timing/compiler/Choice/conditional assignment/private native constructor/caller trace theorem here. Fifteen original named full reports, no rejected predecessor or replay. Native/full Transfer remain owned OPEN.",
